Tandem: these files in this folder were copied from, or generated from, iTerm2
(https://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2, commit 64791fc) and are used under iTerm2's license:

  ai/            the AI prompts, the prompt help text and the model catalog
  scripts/       the script templates and the Python REPL banner
  ColorPresets.plist
  tips.toml      generated by scripts/gen-tips.py from iTerm2's tip data

COPYING-iTerm2 is iTerm2's COPYING (GPL v2 or later) and LICENSE-iTerm2 is iTerm2's LICENSE, the
full license text, both copied verbatim from iTerm2's tree. The subfolders ssh, utilities and
tab_icons carry their own notices. shell_integration/tandem_shell_integration.ps1 is Tandem's own.
